# ============================================================================
#  CursedGems :: what is not this project
# ============================================================================
#  Mirrors .cursorignore, which already keeps these paths out of the editor's
#  context: everything below is either a third-party download or a file one of
#  the tools regenerates, so a fresh clone is the ~2,500 lines of project code
#  and nothing else.
#
#  Note what is deliberately absent: *.rbxm / *.rbxmx. Models are the first
#  assets this repository will actually own (docs/PHASE1_DESIGN.md section 8),
#  so they must stay committable. The single .rbxm in the tree is the Rojo
#  Studio plugin, and `tools/*` below already covers it.
# ============================================================================

# Vendored toolchain: four executables, globalTypes.d.luau, the four release
# zips and the Rojo Studio plugin (~64 MB in total). tools/README.md lists what
# the gate needs and where each file comes from.
tools/*
!tools/README.md

# Generated: the sourcemap the gate rebuilds every run, and build/ (the built
# place, analyze.txt, and the lock file Studio drops beside an open place).
sourcemap.json
build/

# A place file only ever appears here as build output; these patterns are a
# backstop for a rebuild aimed at the repository root instead of build/.
*.rbxl
*.rbxlx
*.lock
